  "content": "[Intro]\n[Gb]\nMake it\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Gb]work Make it\neasy Make it\nclever, craft it into\npieces Make it\n[B]sweet Crimp the\nedges Or make it\nsour and serve with lemon\nwedges Even\n[Gb]doubt Can be de-\nlicious And it\nwashes off of all the\ndirty dishes When it's\n[B]done I can\nsmile It's on\nsomeone else's plate\nfor a while\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Ebm]I'll\nplace it on\n[Ab]display\nAnd then I'll\n[B]slice and\nserve my\n[Db]worries away\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]I can\nfix this I\n[Am]can\ntwist it into\n[Dm]sugar, butter\ncovered pieces\n[Db]Never mind what's\n[C7]underneath it I\n[F]have\ndone it before\n[Am]I'll\nbake me a door\n\n[Bridge]\n[Dm][C]to\n[C#dim7]help me get [Dm]through\n[C]I\n[Gdim7]learned that from [Bb]you\nMama, it's a-\n[Bbm6]mazing what\nbaking can\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Gb]do\nMake it\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Gb]up And sur-\nprise them Tell them\nall my secrets but dis-\nguise them So they\n[B]dance on the\ntongues Of the\nvery people that they're\nsecrets from Make it\n[Gb]soon Make it\nbetter Though,\nbetter never lasts fo-\nrever I'll make it\n[B]small\nso\n[Db]it fits\nEven this\n\n[Interlude]\n[Gb]\nEven now\n[Ebm]\nEven as the\n[Gb]walls come tumb-\nling down\n[B]\nEven as I\n[Gb]can't stop remem-\nbering how\n[B]\nEvery door we ever\n[Gb]made, we never\nonce walked out\n[B]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Abm]Something I never got\n[B]the chance to ask\n[Db]her about\n[Ebm]\nSo with flour\n[Gbsus2/C]on my hands\nI'll show them\n[Gbsus2/Cb]all how\nGoddamn\n[Db]happy I am\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[Dm]Sugar, butter,\nflour Don't let me\n[G]down!\n[F]Let's see the next\namazing\n[Am]thing bak-\ning does\n[F]now",
